Bootstrap: localimage
From: /vol/projects/CIIM/agentic_immunology/singularity/biomni_full.sif

%labels
    Author jalil.nourisa@gmail.com
    Description CIIM image — biomni_full + GRNimmuneClock aging clock + LIANA CCC

%post
    set -e
    pip install --no-cache-dir grnimmuneclock==1.1.0
    pip install --no-cache-dir cellxgene-census
    pip install --no-cache-dir plotnine session-info2
    pip install --no-cache-dir liana==1.7.1

%environment
    export LC_ALL=C.UTF-8
    export LANG=C.UTF-8
    export BIOMNI_PATH=/biomni/data
    export PYTHONPATH=/vol/projects/BIIM/agentic_central/agentic/tools/ciim/code:${PYTHONPATH:-}

%runscript
    exec python "$@"

%help
    CIIM image — biomni_full + GRNimmuneClock.

    Inherits from biomni_full:
        scanpy, anndata, scikit-learn, scipy, numpy, pandas, seaborn,
        decoupler, celltypist, scvi-tools, umap-learn, harmonypy, ...

    Adds:
        grnimmuneclock — cell-type specific immune aging clocks (CD4T, CD8T)
        cellxgene-census — programmatic access to CellxGene Census (~70M cells)
        liana (1.7.1) — cell-cell communication inference (rank_aggregate, consensus LR database)

    Usage:
        singularity exec \
            --bind /vol/projects:/vol/projects \
            /vol/projects/BIIM/agentic_central/singularity/ciim.sif \
            python3 /your_script.py
